@base = http://localhost:3001
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_VERIFIED_SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN
### Minimal liveness
GET {{base}}/health
### Public catalog
GET {{base}}/v1/geography?q=Sorriso
### Coverage and exact supported scientific input tuples
GET {{base}}/v1/coverage?area_id=5107925
### Dated observations (a published rectangle, not Sorriso imagery)
GET {{base}}/v1/observations?area_id=published-field-uberlandia&start=2024-04-01&end=2024-07-31
### Public example
GET {{base}}/v1/examples/yield-soy-5107925-day75
### Verified account
GET {{base}}/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
### Exact fixture request
POST {{base}}/v1/yield-estimates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"municipality_code":"5107925","crop":"soy","harvest_year":2021,"days_after_sowing":75}
### Save authoritative published example
POST {{base}}/v1/comparisons
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: replace-with-a-new-unique-save-key
Content-Type: application/json

{"source":{"kind":"example","example_id":"yield-soy-5107925-day75"},"title":"Sorriso retrospective example"}
### Ensure the technical report of a future simulation (idempotent; locale of the interface, English when absent)
POST {{base}}/v1/simulations/sim_fd61ab4118a4e32398a12156/report
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale":"pt-BR","scope":{"kind":"season","crop_id":"soy","harvest_year":2027}}
### Read a saved report (format=json|html|md); take report_id from the response above
GET {{base}}/v1/simulations/sim_fd61ab4118a4e32398a12156/report?report_id={{reportId}}&format=md
